RUNSPEC
TITLE
   flow_ph_steam: hot water producer that flashes in the wellbore, reference depth at the surface

DIMENS
   20 1 1 /
EQLDIMS
/
TABDIMS
/
WELLDIMS
 2 1 1 2 /
ENTHALPY
STEAM
METRIC
START
   1 'JAN' 2020 /
UNIFOUT
GRID
INIT
DX
   20*5 /
DY
   20*10 /
DZ
   20*10 /
TOPS
   20*995 /
PORO
   20*0.2 /
PERMX
   20*1000 /
PERMY
   20*1000 /
PERMZ
   20*1000 /
HEATCR
   20*600 /
HEATCRT
   20*0 /
THCONR
   20*150 /
PROPS
SWFN
 0.0 0.0  0
 0.5 0.25 0
 1.0 1.0  0 /
SGFN
 0.0 0.0  0
 0.5 0.25 0
 1.0 1.0  0 /
-- closed domain: heated liquid expands, so use a compressible rock to keep the pressure rise modest
ROCK
 30 1.0e-3 /
SOLUTION
PRESSURE
 20*100 /
TEMPI
 20*300 /
SGAS
 20*0 /
SUMMARY
BPR
 1 1 1 /
 10 1 1 /
 20 1 1 /
/
BTEMP
 1 1 1 /
 5 1 1 /
 10 1 1 /
 15 1 1 /
 20 1 1 /
/
SCHEDULE
RPTRST
 'BASIC=2' /
-- the reference depth is the surface (0 m): the wellbore runs from the connections at 1000 m up to the surface.
-- The producer is controlled by the pressure at the surface (the BHP item); the hot water flashes on its way up.
-- The injector injects the volume of water at 150 C and the pressure at the surface.
WELSPECS
 'INJ' 'G' 1  1 0 'WATER' /
 'PRO' 'G' 20 1 0 'WATER' /
/
COMPDAT
 'INJ' 1  1 1 1 'OPEN' 1* 1* 0.2 /
 'PRO' 20 1 1 1 'OPEN' 1* 1* 0.2 /
/
WCONINJE
 'INJ' 'WATER' 'OPEN' 'RESV' 1* 300 /
/
WINJTEMP
 'INJ' 1* 150 /
/
WCONPROD
 'PRO' 'OPEN' 'BHP' 5* 55 /
/
TSTEP
 20*1 /
END
